list":[],"image":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Law.png"},{"title":"Fire &amp; Rescue","text":["Assess fire scenes, monitor hotspots, evaluate structural risks, and provide firefighters with accurate aerial intelligence throughout emergency operations."],"list":[],"image":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Fire.jpg"},{"title":"Search &amp; Rescue","text":["Locate missing persons quickly using thermal imaging, AI-assisted detection, and aerial coverage across difficult terrain and low-visibility environments."],"list":[],"image":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Search.png"},{"title":"Disaster Response","text":["Monitor floods, earthquakes, storms, and other natural disasters while providing real-time situational awareness for emergency management teams."],"list":[],"image":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Disaster.jpg"}]}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/4T-Section-3.jpg","alt":"","bg":true},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"PUBLIC SAFETY DRONE SOLUTIONS"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Advanced Capabilities for Every Operation"},{"t":"p","html":"Modern public safety operations require more than aerial imagery—they demand intelligent systems capable of delivering accurate information, adapting to dynamic environments, and supporting informed decision-making. Our enterprise drone solutions combine advanced sensing technologies, AI-powered capabilities, and reliable flight performance to help emergency teams respond with greater speed, confidence, and operational efficiency."},{"t":"p","html":"High-resolution visual cameras, thermal imaging, laser rangefinders, and AI-assisted object recognition provide responders with actionable intelligence during critical missions. These advanced capabilities help teams identify potential risks, monitor evolving situations, and maintain situational awareness in both day and night operations."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"FEATURED PLATFORM"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"DJI Matrice 4T"},{"t":"p","html":"The DJI Matrice 4T is one of the flagship platforms within our public safety drone portfolio, combining advanced visual imaging, thermal sensing, AI-powered object recognition, and intelligent flight capabilities into a compact enterprise solution. Designed for emergency response, law enforcement, search and rescue, and critical infrastructure operations, it delivers reliable aerial intelligence that enables faster assessments, improved situational awareness, and more effective decision-making in mission-critical environments."},{"t":"img","src":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/4T.png","alt":"","bg":true}]}]}